From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:53:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 10: Backend Integration

- Add AnalysisWorkflowOrchestrator connecting exact-match, structural
  (C++), execution/correctness (Python), and AI analysis into one
  result shaped for direct use as ReportInput.
- Add POST /api/analyze/workflow, wiring the orchestrator to HTTP.
- Add POST /api/analyze/batch, wiring the previously-unrouted
  analyzeBatch() to HTTP (submissions strip raw source bytes from
  the response).
- Add server/src/config/execution.ts (production ExecutionConfig +
  codeaudit/python Docker runtime).
- Fix analysis/batch/compare.ts: pairwise comparison no longer parses
  every submission as C++ unconditionally; non-C++ pairs now report
  structuralSimilarity: null with a stated reason.
- Add 'test' script to package.json; add 6 orchestrator tests plus a
  regression test for the compare.ts fix. Full suite: 63/63 passing.
- Update docs/roadmap.md, docs/architecture.md, docs/decisions.md,
  docs/api-specification.md to document Phase 10 as complete.
